**Step 2: Identify Detection Opportunities**
Map attack lifecycle:
```
Compromise → Delivery → Installation → Persistence → Execution → Exfiltration
  (Rare)   → (Some)  → (Likely)      → (Yes)      → (Yes)     → (Maybe)

