```
Detection Rule: Supply Chain Attack via Compromised Update

Condition: 
  Software update from vendor AND
  Signature certificate invalid OR
  Update hash NOT in known-good list AND
  Followed by system modification

Rule:
```splunk
index=main sourcetype=software_install
  vendor="known_vendor" 
| search certificate_valid=false OR cert_hash NOT IN (lookup good_certs.csv)
